            "review": "So Soft & Amazing Quality for the Price\nI recently bought bedding from Tangelos, and I’m honestly so impressed. The new muslin bed set is incredibly soft—exactly what I was hoping for. The purple color is really unique and looks amazing in my room.\n<br>\nFor the price, the quality is outstanding, and everything feels really well made. Delivery was smooth, which made the whole experience even better.\nI’ll definitely be buying from them again!",
